    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push against fate itself in this intense action-platformer where you embody Sisyphus, the legendary figure cursed by the gods. Battle gravity and your own determination as you guide a massive boulder up an ever-changing mountainside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face treacherous obstacles crafted by the mischievous gods themselves - dodge rolling rocks, leap over sudden chasms, and navigate through storms of divine lightning. Each attempt brings new challenges, but also new opportunities to defy the will of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you finally reach the summit and break free from your eternal punishment, or will the gods prevail in their cruel game? In &quot;Sisyphus the Game,&quot; your persistence is your greatest weapon.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push against fate itself in this intense action-platformer where you embody Sisyphus, the legendary figure cursed by the gods. Battle gravity and your own determination as you guide a massive boulder up an ever-changing mountainside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face treacherous obstacles crafted by the mischievous gods themselves - dodge rolling rocks, leap over sudden chasms, and navigate through storms of divine lightning. Each attempt brings new challenges, but also new opportunities to defy the will of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you finally reach the summit and break free from your eternal punishment, or will the gods prevail in their cruel game? In &quot;Sisyphus the Game,&quot; your persistence is your greatest weapon.</p>",
    "short_description": "An action platformer based on the myth of Sisyphus. The player controls the mythological figure cursed by the gods, pushing a boulder up a mountain while avoiding various obstacles like falling rocks and divine lightning. The game challenges players' persistence and skill as they defy fate.",
